# Contoso Billing architecture rules for `LoopGate arch`.
# Format: kind | pattern | include-glob | exclude-glob | reason
# Every rule names the evidence it encodes. A rule without evidence is an opinion; leave it out.

# ADR 0007: new data access is Dapper in a repository behind an interface.
forbid-package | ^Microsoft\.EntityFrameworkCore | **/*.csproj |  | ADR 0007: data access is Dapper repositories, not EF Core
forbid-text | DbContext | src/**/*.cs |  | ADR 0007: data access is Dapper repositories, not EF Core
forbid-text | SqlHelper. | src/**/*.cs | src/Contoso.Billing/Legacy/** | ADR 0007: SqlHelper is [Obsolete]; only Legacy/ may call it

# IClock.cs: all "now" values come from IClock so tests can freeze time.
forbid-text | DateTimeOffset.UtcNow | src/**/*.cs | src/Contoso.Billing/Common/IClock.cs | IClock.cs: "now" comes from IClock.UtcNow
forbid-text | DateTime.Now | src/**/*.cs |  | IClock.cs: never the local wall clock

# V003: from V003 on, every migration ships with its undo script.
migration-pair | 3 | db/migrations |  | V003 header: a V### without its U### is rejected
